<title>BRAZIL: Most Brazil markets closed for New Year's holiday.</title>
<headline>Most Brazil markets closed for New Year's holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian stock markets and banks will be closed today for the New Year's holiday but interbank dollar-real currency markets will be open through about noon local/1400 GMT, traders said.</p>
<p>All markets will be closed Wednesday, New Year's Day, and will reopen on Thursday.</p>
<p>((--John Miller, Sao Paulo newsroom, 5511 248-5414))</p>
</text>
